{"id":"00240","root":"uni00240_1","name":{"ja":"喜瀬　蛍","en":"Kise Hotaru"},"title":{"ja":"【清秋澄天】","en":"【Clear Autumn Sky】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【清秋澄天】 喜瀬　蛍","en":"【Clear Autumn Sky】 Kise Hotaru"},"aliases":["Kise"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-09-12","limited":false,"characterId":58,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園在籍の対魔忍。明るく面倒見のよい性格で、自然と周りには人が集まる。汎用性の高い特異な能力から、戦闘任務にも抜擢されている。争いごとは嫌いな性格だが、悪事を働く魔族や魔界技術を悪用する組織などを野放しにはできないと、どのような任務でも積極的に受けている。学生時代から大人の対魔忍と対等の力を持っていたという八津紫に憧れており、授業が終わると暇があれば紫に特訓を受けている。戦斧を使うようになったのも、紫への憧れからであるという。破壊力のある重い戦斧は、触れた物の重さを操る彼女の能力と相性が良いが、運搬がしづらいのが難点。日々任務と学業に励む彼女だが、たまのオフには年相応に買い物やおでかけも楽しむ。面倒見がよく驕らない性格の彼女と遊びたがる子は多く、出かけるときはいつも大人数になってしまうが、いつか特別な人と二人っきりでデートをしてみたいとも思っている。","en":"Kise Hotaru is a Taimanin enrolled at Gosha Academy. She has a bright, helpful personality that naturally draws people to her. Because of her highly versatile and unique abilities, she is also selected for combat missions. She dislikes conflict, but she cannot stand demons or organizations that misuse Demon Realm technology, so she eagerly accepts any assignment that lets her stop them. She has long admired Yatsu Murasaki, who possessed adult-level Taimanin power even as a student, and she trains with her whenever she has free time after class. Her use of a battle axe stems from that admiration. The heavy, destructive axe pairs well with her ability to manipulate the weight of objects, though its bulk makes transport cumbersome. She devotes herself daily to missions and studies, but on rare days off she enjoys age-appropriate shopping and outings. Many classmates seek her company because of her caring, unpretentious nature, so outings are always in large groups; still, she hopes to one day go on a private date with someone special."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"水純なな歩","forms":[{"id":"uni00240_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[884,1768],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[103,206],"def":[89,178],"